@startuml
title Schema 变更的发布与验证流程

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #334155
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
  FontColor #0F172A
}

rectangle "变更申请\nadd / drop / rename / reorder / type / nullability" as request #E0F2FE
rectangle "身份检查\n保持或新建 Field ID\n禁止按名称复用旧字段" as identity #DBEAFE
rectangle "兼容性检查" as compatibility {
  rectangle "可直接演进\n新增 optional、rename、reorder\nint->long、float->double" as safe #DCFCE7
  rectangle "需要迁移\n新增 required、收紧 nullability\n缩窄类型或改变语义" as migrate #FEE2E2
}
rectangle "消费者矩阵\nCDC / 消息 / 批流引擎 / 表格式 / 下游" as consumers #FEF3C7
rectangle "分阶段发布\n先 reader，后 writer，再收紧约束" as rollout #FDE68A
rectangle "历史文件验证\n新旧 schema 读取、边界值、分区裁剪、回滚" as verify #DCFCE7

request -down-> identity
identity -down-> safe
identity -down-> migrate
safe -down-> consumers
migrate -down-> consumers
consumers -down-> rollout
rollout -down-> verify

note right of identity
  字段名与位置都会变化；
  稳定 ID 才能连接历史语义
end note

note right of migrate
  allowIncompatibleChanges
  只绕过检查，不会自动修复旧数据
end note
@enduml
